{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01e25367905095958275bb989c5ae537a6c11d64bddb8e39db02915ba0e99146",
      "text": "喜欢的东西？……除了赢比赛之外？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a0ab62c3240987900a43146b2c9a6ab2b05d22e027e6f82bba6122d71f6c8f",
      "text": "嗯。比如你，还有●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5637f8140767876a79680427a2a6d893cb5b88e6fd76942a196c34b94811995",
      "text": "闪闪发光的，只要和这家伙在一起就能一直奔跑下去的\n存在……。大概对我来说，就像希望一样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0103af7f23210d89d99ddd2c4a413503e4a2b62dbefff6582f6d4b2bbe1cf0dc",
      "text": "只要有希望在，无论我身在何处，\n都能回想起在球场上奔跑时那种小鹿乱撞的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad18c7f1fcb1ac9d42b5da97d46b70357d5c3f13bcc93c1095b488e41d5494c",
      "text": "悠介……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab110006b8b0ba4ac10cd4dfeb1738251e461054e39bc5a31e1312055ec637c",
      "text": "无论是足球，还是偶像。\n只要两个人一起跑下去，就一定能到达终点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20ae7e763b6e0e94febb21494a79061e0935838a02774a547fee73651f5bc12d",
      "text": "哪怕绕了再多的远路。\n最强的双胞胎最终拿下的，一定会是VICTORY！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d62498d70021455609c08aa2fb4bec9cd06b6ab0c17f34ef25718fbb3e3fdc",
      "text": "……嗯，说得对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa2fc3bb39e809d567d69256925033acd003675703d6cee032022fae41fa12ff",
      "text": "嘿嘿。好，别垂头丧气的了，跑起来吧！\n要上咯——……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43036fea3e8d00d40dd53693519b5971e2195b13c12e00feb5ba218437464aa7",
      "text": "一、二、一、二……！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
